{"id": 3222, "title": "Fairness", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "fairness", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/3222_fairness.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["两只小狗在争一块饼干，争得很厉害。这时，大狗走了过来。两只小狗看到了希望，不再争了，而是让大狗给它们分那块饼干。", "大狗把饼干从中间分成了两半，两只小狗各拿到一块。但是A小狗告诉大狗，说它的那块小一些，于是，大狗就把B小狗的饼干咬掉一口；B小狗又说自己的饼干没有A小狗的大了，大狗又把A小狗的饼干咬了一口……就这样，两只小狗一次一次地吵，大狗一口一口地咬。结果，一块饼干全让大狗吃了。", "原来，公平只是让双方心里平衡啊！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["兩隻小狗在爭一塊餅乾，爭得很厲害。這時，大狗走了過來。兩隻小狗看到了希望，不再爭了，而是讓大狗給它們分那塊餅乾。", "大狗把餅乾從中間分成了兩半，兩隻小狗各拿到一塊。但是A小狗告訴大狗，說它的那塊小一些，於是，大狗就把B小狗的餅乾咬掉一口；B小狗又說自己的餅乾沒有A小狗的大了，大狗又把A小狗的餅乾咬了一口……就這樣，兩隻小狗一次一次地吵，大狗一口一口地咬。結果，一塊餅乾全讓大狗吃了。", "原來，公平只是讓雙方心裡平衡啊！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["liǎng zhī xiǎo gǒu zài zhēng yī kuài bǐng gān， zhēng de hěn lì hai。 zhè shí， dà gǒu zǒu le guò lái。 liǎng zhī xiǎo gǒu kàn dào le xī wàng， bù zài zhēng le， ér shì ràng dà gǒu gěi tā men fēn nà kuài bǐng gān。", "dà gǒu bǎ bǐng gān cóng zhōng jiān fēn chéng le liǎng bàn， liǎng zhī xiǎo gǒu gè ná dào yī kuài。 dàn shì A xiǎo gǒu gào su dà gǒu， shuō tā de nà kuài xiǎo yī xiē， yú shì， dà gǒu jiù bǎ B xiǎo gǒu de bǐng gān yǎo diào yī kǒu；B xiǎo gǒu yòu shuō zì jǐ de bǐng gān méi yǒu A xiǎo gǒu de dà le， dà gǒu yòu bǎ A xiǎo gǒu de bǐng gān yǎo le yī kǒu …… jiù zhè yàng， liǎng zhī xiǎo gǒu yī cì yī cì de chǎo， dà gǒu yī kǒu yī kǒu de yǎo。 jié guǒ， yī kuài bǐng gān quán ràng dà gǒu chī le。", "yuán lái， gōng píng zhǐ shì ràng shuāng fāng xīn lǐ píng héng a！"], "english_paragraphs": ["Two little dogs were fighting fiercely over a cookie. Just then, a big dog came over. The little dogs saw a way to settle their argument. They stopped fighting and asked the big dog to divide the cookie for them.", "The big dog broke the cookie in half, and each little dog got a piece. But one little dog told the big dog that its piece was smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the other dog’s piece. Then the other little dog said its piece was now smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the first dog’s piece. The little dogs kept arguing, and the big dog kept taking bites. In the end, the big dog ate the whole cookie.", "It turns out that fairness is just about making both sides feel things are even!"], "english_full": "Two little dogs were fighting fiercely over a cookie. Just then, a big dog came over. The little dogs saw a way to settle their argument. They stopped fighting and asked the big dog to divide the cookie for them.\n\nThe big dog broke the cookie in half, and each little dog got a piece. But one little dog told the big dog that its piece was smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the other dog’s piece. Then the other little dog said its piece was now smaller, so the big dog took a bite out of the first dog’s piece. The little dogs kept arguing, and the big dog kept taking bites. In the end, the big dog ate the whole cookie.\n\nIt turns out that fairness is just about making both sides feel things are even!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"liǎng\" data-defn=\"two / both / some / a few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">两</span><span class=\"tr\">兩</span><rt>liǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī\" data-defn=\"classifier for birds and certain animals, one of a pair, some utensils, vessels etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">只</span><span class=\"tr\">隻</span><rt>zhī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo\" data-defn=\"small / tiny / few\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gǒu\" data-defn=\"dog\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">狗</span><span class=\"tr\">狗</span><rt>gǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(used before a verb to indicate an action in progress)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhēng\" data-defn=\"to strive for / to vie for / to argue or debate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">争</span><span class=\"tr\">爭</span><rt>zhēng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kuài\" data-defn=\"classifier for pieces of cloth, cake, soap etc / (coll.) classifier for money and currency units\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">块</span><span class=\"tr\">塊</span><rt>kuài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bǐng gān\" data-defn=\"biscuit; cracker; cookie\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">饼干</span><span class=\"tr\">餅乾</span><rt>bǐng gān</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhēng\" data-defn=\"to strive for / to vie for / to argue or debate\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">争</span><span class=\"tr\">爭</span><rt>zhēng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"structural particle: used after a verb (or adjective as main verb), linking it to following phrase indicating effect, degree, possibility etc\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">得</span><span class=\"tr\">得</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lì hai\" data-defn=\"(used to describe sb or sth that makes a very strong impression, whether favorable or unfavorable) terrible; intense; severe; devastating; amazing; awesome; outstanding / (of a person) stern; strict; harsh; shrewd; tough / (of an animal) fierce / (of a resemblance) striking / (of liquor or chili pepper) strong / (of bacteria) virulent\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">厉害</span><span class=\"tr\">厲害</span><rt>lì hai</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"m